Z||000006||GarethWright||11-13-2001||01:35 AM||||Theres a VERY small used-car dealer about 3 miles from me called Fiero Motors, they have 1 Fiero on the lot, its an 88 formula, auto, NO Options, 2m4 nose and 150k+ miles.  I looked at it when I started looking at Fieros, but they refused to sell for less than 5 grand, so I passed on it,  but I still see it on the way to the hobby store every few weeks.  I doubt it runs, its been there for at least 7 years.||||reg||1
